lChars === \'valid\'"><i class="icon icon-checkmark"></i></div><div ng-if="requiredSpecialChars === \'error\'"><i class="icon icon-cross"></i></div>liczba lub !#$%&*@<li class=password-tips--{{correctLength}}><div ng-if="correctLength === \'valid\'"><i class="icon icon-checkmark"></i></div><div ng-if="correctLength === \'error\'"><i class="icon icon-cross"></i></div>{{MIN_LENGTH}}-{{MAX_LENGTH}} znaków<li class=password-tips--{{strength}}><div ng-if="strength === \'valid\'"><i class="icon icon-checkmark"></i></div><div ng-if="strength === \'error\'"><i class="icon icon-cross"></i></div>{{strengthValue}}<li class="password-tips--{{unpopular}} password-tips__tooltip"><div class=password-tips__tooltip__content><b>Pamiętaj! Hasło do konta powinno być trudne do odgadnięcia!</b> Dla Twojego bezpieczeństwa zablokowaliśmy możliwość ustawienia najczęściej używanych, prostych haseł np. qwert1 lub admi1. Użyj takich kombinacji liter i cyfr, które Ty łatwo zapamiętasz, ale nie będą oczywiste dla osób trzecich.</div><div ng-if="unpopular === \'valid\'"><i class="icon icon-checkmark"></i></div><div ng-if="unpopular === \'error\'"><i class="icon icon-cross"></i></div>niepopularna kombinacja znaków<li ng-if=!parentObj.isTokenForm class=password-tips--{{notUsed}}><div ng-if="notUsed === \'valid\'"><i class="icon icon-checkmark"></i></div><div ng-if="notUsed === \'error\'"><i class="icon icon-cross"></i></div>min. 4 znaki różne od bieżącego hasła<li ng-if=specialError class=password-tips--error><i class="icon icon-cross"></i> {{specialError}}</ul>'),a.put("o.iplsc.com/n/js/common/views/captcha.html",'<div class=captcha><input id=captcha-id type=hidden ttl=30 value={{id}} name=captcha[id]><div class=captcha-input nxt-input nxt-input-placeholder=Kod nxt-input-name=captcha[input] ng-model=captchaInput ng-change=inputChanged(captchaInput)></div><img id=captcha-img class=captcha__img alt="Przepisz kod z obrazka" ng-src={{src}}> <span id=captcha-refresh class="icon icon-refresh" title=Odśwież name=captchaRefresh ng-click=reloadCaptcha()></span></div>'),a.put("o.iplsc.com/n/js/common/views/columnsResize.html",'<div ng-hide=isHidden class=column-resize><div class="column-resize__dots icon icon-slider-dots"></div></div>'),a.put("o.iplsc.com/n/js/common/views/damageMessage.html","<div class=damage-message ng-class=\"{\n        'is-damage': isDamage,\n     }\" id=damage-message>Chwilowo niektóre funkcje poczty mogą być niedostępne. Prosimy o&nbsp;cierpliwość i&nbsp;czas na&nbsp;rozwiązanie problemu.</div>"),a.put("o.iplsc.com/n/js/common/views/dropdown.html","<div class=\"dropdown__icon icon icon-{{::dropdownIcon}}\" ng-class=\"{\n        'dropdown__icon--open': isOpen,\n        'dropdown--select__icon': isSelect\n     }\" ng-click=open() nxt-stop-click-propagation tabindex=-1></div><span ng-if=::isSelect class=\"dropdown__placeholder input-placeholder\" ng-class=\"{\n        'input-placeholder--touched': dropdownText.length > 0\n      }\" ng-bind=dropdownPlaceholder></span><div ng-if=::isSelect class=\"input dropdown__selected-item\" ng-bind-html=dropdownText></div><div class=\"dropdown dropdown--state-{{sublistOpenState}}\" ng-class=\"{\n        'dropdown--open': isOpen,\n        'dropdown--is-calculated': isCalculatedPosition,\n        ['dropdown--' + dropdownStyle]: dropdownStyle,\n        'dropdown--fixed': fixed,\n        'dropdown--top': isTop,\n        'dropdown--select': isSelect,\n        'dropdown--scroll': isScroll\n"+'     }" ng-click=dropdownClick($event) nxt-stop-click-propagation><div class=dropdown__scroll><div class="dropdown__item dropdown__item--back" ng-if=sublistOpenState ng-click=closeSublist($event) nxt-stop-click-propagation><span class="icon icon-arrow-left"></span> Wróć</div><div ng-transclude></div></div></div>'),a.put("o.iplsc.com/n/js/common/views/input.html",'<div class=input-container ng-class="{\n        \'input-container--touched\': isTouched || text.length,\n        \'input-container--error\': isNotEmptyOrTrue(error)\n  